k-2012:p0434:b003:l016","ordinal":328937,"en":"Courage is like the wind,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l017","ordinal":328938,"en":"When you see Semetei,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l018","ordinal":328939,"en":"I can't find it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l019","ordinal":328940,"en":"To put more courage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l020","ordinal":328941,"en":"Attention."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l021","ordinal":328942,"en":"Black giant mustered a lot of courage"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l022","ordinal":328943,"en":"He took a blood drink."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l023","ordinal":328944,"en":"The one who caught the blue mane,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l024","ordinal":328945,"en":"He put a lot of courage,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l025","ordinal":328946,"en":"Caught a blue mane"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l026","ordinal":328947,"en":"Kanykei in old age,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l027","ordinal":328948,"en":"When you get old, go to Bakay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l028","ordinal":328949,"en":"A dream to a soft mind,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l029","ordinal":328950,"en":"The peasant disbelieves in the mind,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l030","ordinal":328951,"en":"Red dress, cross waist,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l031","ordinal":328952,"en":"Aichuruk has a wonderful dream"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l032","ordinal":328953,"en":"To the glittering letter,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l033","ordinal":328954,"en":"From the fog to the sudden thought,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l034","ordinal":328955,"en":"Haven't seen the father type yet."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l035","ordinal":328956,"en":"To the orphan Seitek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l036","ordinal":328957,"en":"Kulchoro himself -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l037","ordinal":328958,"en":"To the rest of the Kyrgyz eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l038","ordinal":328959,"en":"To arrest the murderer,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0434:b003:l039","ordinal":328960,"en":"Money is low in the treasury"}]
